{"comment_text": {"ja45:0.1": "", "ja45:0.2": "", "ja45:0.3": "", "ja45:0.4": "", "ja45:1.1": "Similar to the previous story, a servant girl kills her mother with a pestle while trying to rid her of flies. ", "ja45:1.2": "The initial <i lang='pi' translate='no'>yañce</i> is hard to explain. The commentary offers several options, none of which are terribly convincing.  The previous verse has <i lang='pi' translate='no'>na tveva</i>, of which  <i lang='pi' translate='no'>yañce</i> might be an old corruption. ", "ja45:1.3": "", "ja45:1.4": "", "ja45:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja45:0.1": "<article id='ja45'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja45:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja45:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja45:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja45:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja45:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja45:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja45:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja45:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja45:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja45:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja45:0.3": "Atthakāmavagga ", "ja45:0.4": "5. Rohiṇijātaka ", "ja45:1.1": "“Seyyo amitto medhāvī, ", "ja45:1.2": "Yañce bālānukampako; ", "ja45:1.3": "Passa rohiṇikaṁ jammiṁ, ", "ja45:1.4": "Mātaraṁ hantvāna socatī”ti. ", "ja45:2.1": "Rohiṇijātakaṁ pañcamaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja45:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 45 ", "ja45:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja45:0.3": "Wanting to Help ", "ja45:0.4": "About Rohinī: a past life story ", "ja45:1.1": "Better is an intelligent foe ", "ja45:1.2": "than a foolish sympathizer. ", "ja45:1.3": "See that wretched Rohinī, ", "ja45:1.4": "grieving after killing her mother. ", "ja45:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja45:0.1": "", "ja45:0.2": "", "ja45:0.3": "", "ja45:0.4": "", "ja45:1.1": "", "ja45:1.2": "", "ja45:1.3": "", "ja45:1.4": "", "ja45:2.1": "Rohiṇijātakaṁ → rohiṇījātakaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja45:0.1": "", "ja45:0.2": "", "ja45:0.3": "", "ja45:0.4": "", "ja45:1.1": "ms22J_98, msdiv45, pts-vp-pli1.249", "ja45:1.2": "", "ja45:1.3": "", "ja45:1.4": "", "ja45:2.1": "ms22J_99"}, "keys_order": ["ja45:0.1", "ja45:0.2", "ja45:0.3", "ja45:0.4", "ja45:1.1", "ja45:1.2", "ja45:1.3", "ja45:1.4", "ja45:2.1"]}